# The SPANISH service-menu tree, walked in ONE entry.
#
# dmd/es-menu/ proved the menu is capturable in Spanish -- F19's country re-derivation
# lives on the EXIT path, so a walk that opens the menu once and navigates with select,
# scroll and BACK never runs it (the store still reads country 5 at the end).  That walk
# covered three branches; this one walks the whole tree the same way.
#
# The traversal is mechanical rather than tree-shaped, because it does not need to know
# the shape: for each of the root's items, enter it, then step through its own items in
# turn -- select, dwell, back -- and back out to the root before the next.  Records that
# do not exist under a given parent simply redraw the parent, which costs a scene and
# nothing else.
#
# Navigation is F14's: 7 opens (0x3F), Right Shift selects (0x42), Left Shift scrolls
# (0x41), 1 goes back (0x40).  TEST is never pressed again -- that is the whole point.
#
# Requires scripts/keyscripts/iomoont-spain.cfg copied to <cfg dir>/iomoont.cfg.
   40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
 1400 mark open-menu
 1410 tap 12 KEYCODE_7
 2200 mark svc-root
 2500 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 2650 mark branch-1
 2900 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 3050 mark branch-1-item-1
 3350 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 3600 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 3850 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 4000 mark branch-1-item-2
 4300 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 4550 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 4800 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 4950 mark branch-1-item-3
 5250 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 5500 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 5750 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 5900 mark branch-1-item-4
 6200 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 6450 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 6700 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 6850 mark branch-1-item-5
 7150 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 7400 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 7650 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 7800 mark branch-1-item-6
 8100 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 8350 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 8600 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 8750 mark branch-1-item-7
 9050 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
 9300 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
 9550 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
 9700 mark branch-1-item-8
10000 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
10250 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
10500 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
10650 mark branch-1-item-9
10950 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
11200 tap 12 KEYCODE_LSHIFT
11450 tap 12 KEYCODE_RSHIFT
